      "content": "For 36 mouse liver samples from a fasting time course, I want to estimate how active each transcription factor is in each sample, apart from its own mRNA level, together with signed activating or repressing effects on its targets. We have the expression matrix, a motif prior and a TF-TF PPI with matching IDs."
